<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Let me take a pound of ointment pure</l><l>Of great value to anoint Your feet</l><l>And wipe them with my hair</l><l>That the house be filled with the fragrance</l><l>Of the ointment.</l><l>I love You!</l><l>Jesus, I love You!</l><l>May I waste my all and life on You.</l><l>Let me pour the ointment pure</l><l>On Your head and on Your feet,</l><l>On You, most precious One</l><l>Because I love You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
